ive owners, claim dates, and `in-progress` status. The new Wave plan records the MVP scope, Mac-only app track, and assignments for two planned waves.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n<strong>Priority: <picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/priority-low-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Low</strong>\n\n**Estimated code review effort:** 2 (Simple) | ~8 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"3b5b592c8d04626599f7b516e27da7b82196b41f\" -->\n**Change:** Other\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n**Possibly related PRs**\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#15](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/15): Establishes the tracker and rules for lot ownership and claims.\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#16](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/16): Updates lot readiness and dependencies in the same tracker.\n\n**Suggested reviewers:** `claude`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> · up to <code>3b5b5</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `3b5b5`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"3b5b592c8d04626599f7b516e27da7b82196b41f\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"3b5b592c8d04626599f7b516e27da7b82196b41f\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThe lot claims and wave plan are ready to merge.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Architecture risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-low-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Low</strong> · up to <code>3b5b5</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- architecture_review_start -->\n<!-- architecture_review_label\n### Architecture Summary\n\n**Architecture risk:** **🔵 Low** · up to `3b5b5`\n-->\n\nThe change affects 1 system.\n\n**Changed systems:** `docs`\n\n**Architecture concerns**\nNo architecture-level concerns identified.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Review details</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n**Systems and components**\n- _observed_ — docs (service) was modified; 1 changed file maps to changed impact.\n\n**Before / after behavior**\n- _observed_ — Modified behavior in docs/LOTS.md: LOT-023 and LOT-024 now have Mac-session owners dated 2026-10-27 and `in-progress` status instead of no owner and `todo`.\n- _observed_ — Modified behavior in docs/LOTS.md: LOT-034, LOT-036, and LOT-037 now have Mac-session owners dated 2026-10-27 and `in-progress` status instead of no owner and `todo`. LOT-035 remains unchanged.\n- _observed_ — Modified behavior in docs/LOTS.md: LOT-043 now has a Mac-session owner dated 2026-10-27 and `in-progress` status instead of no owner and `todo`.\n- _observed_ — Modified behavior in docs/LOTS.md: Adds a Wave plan identifying the orchestrator, defining the MVP scope and Mac-only execution for app lots, and listing Wave 1 assignments and a planned Wave 2 lot set.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- architecture_review_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 5</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n|         Check name         |                                             Status                                             | Explanation                                                                                                                                 